SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:15:20 and reappears at 18:06:26 IST\, se
 en from Surat.\nThe Moon is 39° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +20°.\nTi
 mes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's
  edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Surat
